[E0405] Error: cannot move what a projection lends
    ╭─[ err/60_projection_uses/main.wip:22:18 ]
    │
 22 │     consume(move heaviestVar(&var bag))
    │                  ──────────┬──────────
    │                            ╰──────────── lent by a projection, and owned by the caller
    │
    │ Help: a projection lends a place that belongs to its caller; nothing is taken out of it
    │
    │ Note: a reference can read a value but cannot take ownership of it
────╯
[E0413] Error: `bag` is passed together with a `&var` reference to it
    ╭─[ err/60_projection_uses/main.wip:26:38 ]
    │
 26 │     both(&var heaviestVar(&var bag), &bag)
    │          ─────────────┬────────────  ──┬─
    │                       ╰──────────────────── a `&var` reference
    │                                        │
    │                                        ╰─── a `&` reference
    │
    │ Note: while a function runs, a `&var` argument must be the only reference to its place
────╯
